    "Cloudflare rejected the credentials. Verify the Access Key and Secret have Object Read & Write on this bucket." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare hat die Zugangsdaten abgelehnt. Prüfe, ob Access Key und Secret die Berechtigung „Object Read & Write“ für diesen Bucket haben."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare ha rechazado las credenciales. Comprueba que la Access Key y el Secret tengan permiso Object Read & Write en este bucket."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare a refusé les identifiants. Vérifiez que l'Access Key et le Secret disposent de l'autorisation Object Read & Write sur ce bucket."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare ha rifiutato le credenziali. Verifica che l'Access Key e la Secret abbiano i permessi Object Read & Write su questo bucket."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare が認証情報を拒否しました。Access Key と Secret がこのバケットに Object Read & Write 権限を持つか確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare가 자격 증명을 거부했습니다. Access Key와 Secret이 이 버킷에 대해 Object Read & Write 권한을 가지고 있는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Cloudflare rejeitou as credenciais. Verifique se a Access Key e a Secret têm permissão Object Read & Write neste bucket."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare отклонил учетные данные. Убедитесь, что у Access Key и Secret есть права Object Read & Write для этого бакета."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare 拒绝了该凭证，请确认 Access Key 和 Secret 对此存储桶具有 Object Read & Write 权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare 拒絕了此憑證。請確認 Access Key 和 Secret 對此儲存貯體具有 Object Read & Write 權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloudflare returned an authentication error. Verify the Access Key ID and Secret Access Key, and that the token has Object Read & Write permission on this bucket." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare hat einen Authentifizierungsfehler gemeldet. Prüfe Access Key ID und Secret Access Key und ob das Token die Berechtigung „Object Read & Write“ für diesen Bucket hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare ha devuelto un error de autenticación. Comprueba el Access Key ID y la Secret Access Key, y que el token tenga permiso Object Read & Write en este bucket."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare a renvoyé une erreur d'authentification. Vérifiez l'Access Key ID et la Secret Access Key, ainsi que l'autorisation Object Read & Write du jeton sur ce bucket."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare ha restituito un errore di autenticazione. Verifica l'Access Key ID e la Secret Access Key e che il token abbia i permessi Object Read & Write su questo bucket."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare が認証エラーを返しました。Access Key ID と Secret Access Key を確認し、このバケットに対して Object Read & Write 権限があるか確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare에서 인증 오류가 반환되었습니다. Access Key ID와 Secret Access Key를 확인하고, 해당 토큰이 이 버킷에 대해 Object Read & Write 권한을 갖고 있는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Cloudflare retornou um erro de autenticação. Verifique a Access Key ID e a Secret Access Key, e se o token tem permissão Object Read & Write neste bucket."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare вернул ошибку аутентификации. Проверьте Access Key ID и Secret Access Key, а также наличие у токена прав Object Read & Write для этого бакета."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare 返回了身份验证错误，请验证 Access Key ID 和 Secret Access Key，并确认该令牌对此存储桶具有 Object Read & Write 权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
